602230/extras/motionrec_gif03__1_.gif?t=1745586012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make good use of the MotionRec ability to unravel the mysteries behind this devastated world ruled by machines!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HANDSUM inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Artist:</strong> m7kenji</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Composer:</strong> KyoheiFujita</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Developer:</strong> shoma</p>","developers":["HANDSUM"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/e5a477bb64ea10d3295047c7df24d4e8760c489a/header.jpg?t=1745586012","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 HANDSUM inc. All rights reserved. Licensed to and published by Active Gaming Media Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium D 830 (2* 3000) or equivalent / AMD Athlon 64 4000+ (2600) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (256 MB) / Radeon HD 2400 PRO (256 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium D 830 (2* 3000) or equivalent / AMD Athlon 64 4000+ (2600) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (256 MB) / Radeon HD 2400 PRO (256 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130202,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25